{"variant_id": "DEMO_V_001", "source": "variant_demo", "no": 1, "kind": "variant", "text": "太阳之为病,脉浮,头项强痛而恶寒也。"}
{"variant_id": "DEMO_V_013", "source": "variant_demo", "no": null, "kind": "variant", "text": "太阳病,头痛,发热,汗出,恶风,桂枝汤主之。"}
{"variant_id": "DEMO_V_035", "source": "variant_demo", "no": null, "kind": "variant", "text": "太阳病,头痛发热,身疼腰痛,骨节疼痛,恶风,无汗而喘,麻黄汤主之也。"}
{"variant_id": "DEMO_C_012", "source": "commentary_demo", "no": null, "kind": "commentary", "text": "太阳中风,啬啬恶寒,翕翕发热,鼻鸣干呕,故以桂枝汤解肌和营卫也。"}
{"variant_id": "DEMO_X_999", "source": "variant_demo", "no": null, "kind": "variant", "text": "此为后世托名之文,与本论诸条皆不相涉。"}
